// Discount names and order tags per store, read live from the "Evergreen
// Discounts Tags" Google Sheet (2026-11-04, Tomer: "all the sales and the
// tags on the sales pull from this sheet"). One tab per store, two columns:
// "Discount Name" | "Tag". The Discounts Breakdown uses it for its SALES box
// (each sale program = the discounts on orders carrying that sale's tag) and
// for bundles / sets.
//
// The backend reads the tab's CSV export, which only works while the sheet is
// shared as "Anyone with the link — Viewer". Until then (or if Google is
// down) it falls back to the copy below, taken from the sheet on 2026-11-04,
// so the section never breaks — it just won't pick up new rows.

